.TH update 1  "update " 
.SH NAME
update \- Update title or description of an existing active knowledge element
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBupdate\fR [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIELEMENT_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update title or description of an existing active knowledge element
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
New title for the element
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
New description for the element
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIELEMENT_ID\fR>
Element ID (UUID) to update
